  "solution": "Solution:\n\nWe have to follow the BODMAS rule\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/1990743799104f72f2abd6652abaa7fa2655f318b14e04461d14c46970986fe3.png] \n\nCalculation\n\n[{37.4 + 152.6} ÷ {185.6 - 175.6}] × 15.5 + 35.5 = ? × 82.5\n\n⇒ 190 ÷ 10 × 15.5 + 35.5 = ? × 82.5\n\n⇒ 19 × 15.5 + 35.5 = ? × 82.5\n\n⇒ 294.5 + 35.5 = ? × 82.5\n\n⇒ 330 = ? × 82.5\n\n? = 330/82.5 = 4\n\n**The answer is 4.**",
